# Never commit secrets or runtime junk
.env
__pycache__/
*.pyc
watch.html
*.log
# The trade journal is YOUR record of hand-placed gold trades. It grows without
# bound and is personal execution data, not project state, so it stays local.
# Set ICC_JOURNAL=/some/path to keep it elsewhere (e.g. a synced drive).
journal.jsonl

# NOTE: scanner_state.json IS tracked (it holds the weekly trade counter;
# GitHub Actions commits it back so the 1-2/week cap persists across runs).
